🔐 🏛️ CodingDojo: Login, Registration & The Wall System
A fully integrated web application built with the Django framework, combining a user account management and protection system (login_app) with an interactive posts and comments wall (wall_app), implementing strict database relationships, security conditions, and time-based restrictions.

🚀 Features
1. Login & Account Management App (login_app):

Fully Separated Pages: Independent and styled interfaces for both registration and login operations for better user experience.
Strict Validation System (Backend Validations):

First and last name (required, at least 2 characters, letters only).
Email (valid format, checked for uniqueness in the database Ninja Bonus).
Birthday and age (date must be in the past Ninja Bonus, user must be at least 13 years old to comply with COPPA child protection rules Sensei Bonus).
Password (at least 8 characters, must match the confirmation field).


Password Hashing: Full security protection for hashing and salting passwords using the bcrypt library before saving to the database.
Flash Messages: Accurate and field-specific error notifications using Django's Tags system.

2. Interactive Wall App (wall_app):

Route Protection: Prevents any non-logged-in user from accessing the wall via direct URL and automatically redirects them to the home page.
Posts and Comments: Ability to write posts and add comments on each post, with complete table separation in the database via a One-to-Many relationship.
Chronological Order: Posts are displayed from newest to oldest (top of the page).
Smart Delete Feature (Sensei Bonus): The delete button appears only on posts that the user wrote themselves, and they are only allowed to delete within 30 minutes of posting.


🛠️ Tech Stack

Backend: Python / Django 5.x
Frontend: HTML5 / CSS3 / Bootstrap 5 (smooth and modern styling)
Database: SQLite (built on the required ERD structure)
Security: Bcrypt (password hashing) & Django Sessions (session management)


📂 Project Structure
textwall_project/
│
├── login_app/                # User management and validation app
│   ├── templates/
│   │   ├── register.html     # Account creation page
│   │   └── login.html        # Standalone login page
│   ├── models.py             # User model and UserManager for validations
│   └── views.py              # Hashing, Sessions, and routing logic
│
├── wall_app/                 # Wall and comments app
│   ├── templates/
│   │   └── wall.html         # Interactive wall interface
│   ├── models.py             # Message & Comment models linked to User
│   └── views.py              # Post, comment, and 30-minute delete restriction logic
│
├── wall_project/             # Central project settings
│   ├── settings.py           # App registration and session configuration
│   └── urls.py               # Central project URLs
└── manage.py